From 53df5abbd72915ac8229fc790a3d0d0a23f825b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:46:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Real subtitle pipeline: route /api/translate media requests
 to the FFmpeg/Whisper worker

- translate.js: media branch now calls the worker (translate job: R2 -> Whisper -> cue translation -> VTT on R2) instead of asking Gemini to read a URL
- Only public BAARO R2 URLs (videos/posts/stories) are forwarded to the worker
- dub mode returns an explicit 501 instead of fake WebVTT
- vercel.json: maxDuration 300 for api/translate.js; client timeout 290s

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XttQVh8guyrdFTtm9S8eUN
---
